# API Changelog 0.1 vs. 0.1


## API Changes

### GET /books/{bookId}
- :warning: the `bookid` request header's property `name` was restricted to a list of enum values
-  added the enum value `VALUE_1` to the property `name` of the `header` request parameter `bookid`
-  added the enum value `VALUE_2` to the property `name` of the `header` request parameter `bookid`
-  added the enum value `VALUE_3` to the property `name` of the `header` request parameter `bookid`






